        "content_with_weight": "<file name=\"p_0775dffd822295ef2634.pdf\">\n# Cedar matrix A\nControlled synthetic parser diagnostic / signed revision 7\nCurrent signed values apply. Archived fees are historical references only.\n|  Region | Tier | Current signed |   | Archived | State  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|   |  | Fee (CNY) | Limit | Old fee |   |\n|  East | Basic | 210 | 4 | 21 | Signed  |\n|   |  Pro | 420 | 8 | 42 | Signed  |\n|  West | Basic | 310 | 6 | 31 | Signed  |\n|   |  Pro * | 620 | 12 | 62 | Signed  |\nThe West region continues on page 2 with its Enterprise tier.\n* The dated fee adjustment is on page 2. Limits do not change.\nCedar matrix A | Revision 7 | Page 1\n# Cedar matrix A\nControlled synthetic parser diagnostic / signed revision 7\nCurrent signed values apply. Archived fees are historical references only.\n|  Region | Tier | Current signed |  | Archived | State  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|   |  | Fee (CNY) | Limit | Old fee |   |\nContinuation: the first row below belongs to West.\n|  West | Enterprise | 930 | 18 | 93 | Signed  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  South | Basic | 410 | 7 | 41 | Draft  |\n|   |  Pro | 820 | 14 | 82 | Draft  |\n* From 2026-11-01, West Pro uses fee 680 CNY instead of 620 CNY.\nIts limit remains 12. This dated note overrides the main table fee.\nDraft rows are not approved. No bank-routing number is published.\nCedar matrix A | Revision 7 | Page 2\n</file>",
